  "final_message": "All next steps are complete. Final state of the work:\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`): Flask + SQLite app \u2014 users/tokens auth (`POST /api/auth/register|login`, Bearer tokens), weather reports (`GET/POST /api/weather`, `GET/PUT/DELETE /api/weather/{id}` with PUT clearing omitted optionals), lookup recording + `GET /api/weather/recent`, seeding of 6 cities on first start, SPA fallback serving of `frontend/dist`. `backend/requirements.txt` regenerated with hashed pins so the Dockerfile's `pip install -c requirements.lock` works (the scaffold's `--hash` lock had broken it).\n\n**Frontend** (React 19 + TS + Vite 8 + Tailwind v4): `App.tsx` now wires everything together \u2014 register/sign-in panels with API error messages, signed-in bar with sign-out, city search with \"No weather data for X\", browser-side \u00b0C/\u00b0F switch, 5 recent lookups (click repeats search), and full report management (paged list, add/edit forms showing API validation messages, delete with confirm).\n\n**Verification** (all passing):\n- `tsc --noEmit` clean; `npm ci && npm run build` reproducible\n- Gunicorn (`gunicorn --pythonpath backend app:app`, port 8000): health, static assets, SPA fallback, full API suite (auth, CRUD, validation 400s, paging/ordering envelope, case-insensitive search, lookups `found` flags) plus restart persistence (token/lookups/reports survive)\n- 33-check jsdom UI test driving the real bundle against the live API: render, search found/not-found, unit conversion, lookup click-to-repeat, register/duplicate/login/logout, add/edit/clear-fields/delete-with-cancel\n- Cleanup done: scratch dirs, test DBs, `__pycache__` removed; only intended files changed per `git status`\n\nNothing left pending. The only thing not verifiable in this sandbox is `docker build` itself (no Docker daemon), but every command in the Dockerfile was executed and verified directly.",
